			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:08:50,040",
				"to": "00:09:14,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 530040,
				"to": 554960
			},
			"text": " So when I imagine who I am being in this moment in preparation for the next moment, I am now"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:14,960",
				"to": "00:09:22,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 554960,
				"to": 562700
			},
			"text": " in this moment feeling okay."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:22,700",
				"to": "00:09:28,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 562700,
				"to": 568880
			},
			"text": " I'm not feeling poor or fair or moderate."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:28,880",
				"to": "00:09:40,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 568880,
				"to": 580740
			},
			"text": " I'm feeling okay, which metaphorically means my head is above the water, but my arms and"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:40,740",
				"to": "00:09:47,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 580740,
				"to": 587740
			},
			"text": " legs are underneath the water treading calmly, right?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:47,740",
				"to": "00:09:54,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 587740,
				"to": 594280
			},
			"text": " But I'm working to keep my head above the water."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:54,280",
				"to": "00:10:09,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 594280,
				"to": 609600
			},
			"text": " So I'm in that process of just, yeah, basically just treading water until I get a leg up to"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:09,600",
				"to": "00:10:24,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 609600,
				"to": 624880
			},
			"text": " get out of the water and start plugging back into the world."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:24,880",
				"to": "00:10:38,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 624880,
				"to": 638040
			},
			"text": " So in my breakdown of this question, what would be powerful is if in this continual"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:38,040",
				"to": "00:10:49,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 638040,
				"to": 649040
			},
			"text": " moment of being, I were able to take my faculties, my energy, my frequency, and pour it into"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:49,040",
				"to": "00:10:59,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 649040,
				"to": 659840
			},
			"text": " projects that help people in some way, connect to others, connect to themselves, connect"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:59,840",
				"to": "00:11:05,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 659840,
				"to": 665560
			},
			"text": " to their family, connect to the world, it gets them out of their head, gets them out"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:05,560",
				"to": "00:11:14,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 665560,
				"to": 674320
			},
			"text": " of their bubble, gets them out from under the bridge, gets them out of their basement,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:14,320",
				"to": "00:11:21,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 674320,
				"to": 681320
			},
			"text": " gets them out of the attic, actually gets them out and interacting with another human"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:21,320",
				"to": "00:11:28,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 681320,
				"to": 688880
			},
			"text": " being."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:28,880",
				"to": "00:11:47,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 688880,
				"to": 707600
			},
			"text": " I was ready to call this whole thing quits more than once in the past three years."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:47,600",
				"to": "00:11:51,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 707600,
				"to": 711320
			},
			"text": " And I stuck it out."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:51,320",
				"to": "00:12:00,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 711320,
				"to": 720280
			},
			"text": " And always being in this moment, there are times I have no idea where I will be on this"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:00,280",
				"to": "00:12:12,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 720280,
				"to": 732000
			},
			"text": " timeline, you know, a day, 10 days, a year from now, because I can only be in this moment."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:12,000",
				"to": "00:12:18,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 732000,
				"to": 738120
			},
			"text": " But the things I do in this moment determine where I show up on that timeline."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:18,120",
				"to": "00:12:22,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 738120,
				"to": 742220
			},
			"text": " The timeline's gonna happen, I'm moving through it, you're moving through it, we're all moving"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:22,220",
				"to": "00:12:23,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 742220,
				"to": 743640
			},
			"text": " through it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:23,640",
				"to": "00:12:30,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 743640,
				"to": 750080
			},
			"text": " But where you end up and how you end up there is all based on the now."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:30,080",
				"to": "00:12:40,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 750080,
				"to": 760560
			},
			"text": " What are you doing right now with your resources, your agency, your energy, your frequency,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:40,560",
				"to": "00:12:50,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 760560,
				"to": 770000
			},
			"text": " and your abilities, I guess that's the more important question to be asking is what does"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:50,000",
				"to": "00:12:59,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 770000,
				"to": 779900
			},
			"text": " it feel like to think about all those things in this moment?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:59,900",
				"to": "00:13:02,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 779900,
				"to": 782440
			},
			"text": " Does it cause dread?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:02,440",
				"to": "00:13:10,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 782440,
				"to": 790440
			},
			"text": " Does it make you feel possibility, opportunity?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:10,440",
				"to": "00:13:12,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 790440,
				"to": 792580
			},
			"text": " Does it feel overwhelmed?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:12,580",
				"to": "00:13:15,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 792580,
				"to": 795540
			},
			"text": " Does it make you shake inside?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:15,540",
				"to": "00:13:19,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 795540,
				"to": 799200
			},
			"text": " Does it make you want to run and hide?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:19,200",
				"to": "00:13:29,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 799200,
				"to": 809520
			},
			"text": " I guess that's me flipping the question back on itself after doing all this jabbering."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:29,520",
				"to": "00:13:31,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 809520,
				"to": 811880
			},
			"text": " I think I'll end it there for now."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:31,880",
				"to": "00:13:38,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 811880,
				"to": 818640
			},
			"text": " I got a lot of shit to do, I need to make some money."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:38,640",
				"to": "00:13:42,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 818640,
				"to": 822640
			},
			"text": " Okay, peace out, be well."
		}
	]
}
